# Tri-platform eol policy (family build bar, BAP ADR 0031): text files normalize to LF
# so a Windows clone under core.autocrlf=true cannot rewire line endings; the
# digest-pinned conformance corpora are byte-exact and carry no conversion at all.
* text=auto eol=lf
conformance/corpus/** -text
conformance/corpus-v2/** -text
conformance/corpus-v3/** -text
conformance/corpus-local-loopback-http/** -text
conformance/corpus-role-attestation/** -text
